---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro"
---

<Layout title="Privacy: Excaliself" description="What this website and the Excaliself app collect. In short: anonymous page views, and nothing from the app.">
  <main id="main" class="page pt-16 pb-10 md:pt-24">
    <article class="grid-12 gap-y-10">
      <div class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-4">
        <h1 class="display text-display">Privacy</h1>
        <p class="hand mt-6 text-xl text-pen">short version: we count page views, the app counts nothing</p>
      </div>
      <div class="col-span-12 flex max-w-[38rem] flex-col gap-10 lg:col-span-7 lg:col-start-6">
        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight">This website</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-muted">Static pages and no cookies. Self-hosted OpenPanel counts page views and outgoing link clicks without cookies or personal data. The host also sees ordinary request logs.</p>
        </section>
        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight">The Excaliself app</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-muted">You run it on your own server. Accounts, drawings, and pasted images are stored in your Postgres database. The app does not phone home and sends no telemetry.</p>
        </section>
        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Questions</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-muted"><a href="https://github.com/maciekzygmunt/excaliself/issues" class="link font-medium text-ink">Open an issue on GitHub</a> and it gets answered there.</p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </article>
  </main>
</Layout>
